{
    "title": "Magic Star",
    "description": "Idol development system, popular social music game! (*\u2579\u25bd\u2579*) Welcome everyone to Nico's singing and dancing world~\r\n\"Magic star\" is a music game with a lively style using the concept of idols!\r\nGorgeous costumes, personalized mounts, massive music songs, everything you want is here. Scroll down quickly and let Nico introduce it to you, idols\u10da(\u2579\u25e1\u2579\u10da)\r\n\r\n\u203bDancing & Rhythmic Life\r\n!!Attention: non-combatants please evacuate quickly, this is a gathering of dancing masters~\r\nThere are 4 modes in Charming Dance: Rhythm, Classic, Tempo, Tradition. There is also a massive music songs of different genres, bringing a super realistic stage singing experience~\r\nThere is another secret, Nico will tell you quietly (\u3065\uffe33\uffe3): When the game is over, you can click \"Save\" to store this game recording in the video gallery, and you can watch it anytime you want~ It can also become a hot video ~\r\n\r\n\u203bKaraoke King  Enjoy the Sound of Nature\r\nHow can it only have dancing? (\u0e51\u2032\u1d17\u2035\u0e51)~~ Let everyone know about your wonderful singing voice! Select the karaoke mode in the game, choose your favorite song and sing as loudly as you want~\r\nWho said that a concert requires many steps and requirements? In the game, \u10da(\u2579\u25e1\u2579\u10da) you can start your own concert on your own!\r\nThere is also a unique sync mode, which can create new bonds with queens/kings of Karaoke!\r\n\r\n\u203b Brand New Community  More Fun to Play\r\n(,,\uff65\u2200\uff65)\uff89\u309bHi~~~Nico also brought new information! ! ! The main community has been revised~\r\nThe main community is not only expanding, but also adding many interactive facilities, such as carousels, swing planes, pedal pianos, etc.~~\r\nDo, re, mi, fa, sol, la, si~ What sound is that? \u0669(\u0e51>\u25e1<\u0e51)\u06f6 Is the sound of Nico dancing on the piano keys~~~~\r\n\r\n\u203b Shining Star   Ever-changing Shapes\r\nHow to become a fashionista in the Idol Party world ??\r\nPleasant fashions, campus energetic girls' clothing, trendy men's casual clothing, beautiful ancient style clothing, and limited sets are available for idols to unlock. \u2570(*\u00b0\u25bd\u00b0*)\u256fWhat are the idols still hesitating about~\r\n\r\n\u203b (\u0e51\u2032\u1d17\u2035\u0e51) The fashionable music and dance game \"Magic Star\" is looking forward to your joining, (.-\u03c9-)~~Hurry up and search for and download it on your phone!\r\nFacebook fan group: https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=100070414744245\r\nCustomer service email: xipucwtg@gmail.com",
